[65.50853, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G- \u001b[1mIn the design:\u001b[20G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdesign/index.html:127-134\u001b[46G\u001b[39mhas\u001b[50Gan\u001b[53G\"Events\"\u001b[62Gsection\u001b[70Gon\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Ghome\u001b[82Gpage,\u001b[88Gright\u001b[94Gbelow\u001b[100Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bnews\u001b[10Gcards.\u001b[17GIt's\u001b[22Ga\u001b[24G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m<ul class=\"events\">\u001b[44G\u001b[39mwith\u001b[49Gthree\u001b[55Ghard-coded\u001b[66Gentries\u001b[74G(15\u001b[78GNov\u001b[82Gbeach\u001b[88Gclean-up,\u001b[98G22\u001b[101GNov\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gbudget forum, 5 Dec job fair). Each entry has a\u001b[53Gdat\u001b[57G badge.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe styling is already in the sitepackage:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mpackages/mtosafi_sitepackage/Resources/Private/Scss/_components.scss:200\u001b[78G\u001b[39mdefines\u001b[86G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.events\u001b[94G\u001b[39mand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.events__date\u001b[39m, and that compiles into \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Public/Css/main.css\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe source data:\u001b[22m the \"Events\" part of \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdes\u001b[47Ggn/docs/news-and-\u001b[65Gvent\u001b[70G.docx\u001b[39m, after the news entries.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWhat's missing:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GNo\u001b[8GFluid\u001b[14Gtemplate,\u001b[24GTypoScript\u001b[35Gor\u001b[38Gsite\u001b[43Gset\u001b[47Gin\u001b[50Gthe\u001b[54Gsitepackage\u001b[66Guses\u001b[71G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mevents\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInitialisation/data.xml\u001b[29G\u001b[39mcontains\u001b[38Gno\u001b[41Gevent\u001b[47Grecords.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BThe README's initial-c\u001b[28Gntent section only\u001b[47Gsays the n\u001b[58Gws w\u001b[63Gs imported (list\u001b[80Gpage,\u001b[86Gdetail\u001b[93Gpage,\u001b[99Gnews\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gfolder, home page plugins). It doesn't mention events.\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1Bre's no eve\u001b[20Gts extensio\u001b[32G in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcomposer.json\u001b[39m, only\u001b[56G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgeorgringer/news\u001b[39m.\u001b[74G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSo the news from \u001b[21Ghe docx was\u001b[33Gcarried over, but\u001b[51Gthe events weren't. If\u001b[74Gyou\u001b[78Gwant\u001b[83Gthem\u001b[88Gon\u001b[91Gthe\u001b[95Ghome\u001b[100Gpage\u001b[105Gas\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bin\u001b[6Gthe\u001b[10Gdesign,\u001b[18Gone\u001b[22Gway\u001b[26Gis\u001b[29Gto\u001b[32Gstore\u001b[38Gthem\u001b[43Gas\u001b[46Gnews\u001b[51Grecords\u001b[59Gin\u001b[62Gtheir\u001b[68Gown\u001b[72Gcategory\u001b[81Gand\u001b[85Gadd\u001b[89Ga\u001b[91Gsecond\u001b[98Gnews\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bplugin\u001b[10Gunder the\u001b[20Gnews \u001b[26Gn the home page. Should I prepare that?\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCrunched for 22s · done 7:12 PM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mwhat technique should we use to display them?\u001b[39m                                                           \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[39m Running \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command…\u001b[K\r\u001b[37C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mought for 7s)\u001b[39m\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
