[87.290242, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m^13.4.29 || ^14.3\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgeor\u001b[32Gringer/new\u001b[43G ^13 || ^14\u001b[39m. The project uses \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcms-core ^14.3\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mnews ^14.1\u001b[39m,\u001b[104Gso\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bit fits. It's Composer-only: the\u001b[38GTER listing stops at 6.x for TYPO3 12,\u001b[77Gwhich\u001b[83Gdoesn't\u001b[91Gmatter\u001b[98Gfor\u001b[102Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GComposer project.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe events fit its fields.\u001b[32G\u001b[22mA\u001b[34Gnews\u001b[39Grecord\u001b[46Ggets\u001b[51Gan\u001b[54G\"is\u001b[58Gevent\"\u001b[65Gswitch,\u001b[73Gan\u001b[76Gend\u001b[80Gdate,\u001b[86Ga\u001b[88Gfull-day\u001b[97Gflag,\u001b[103Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  location a\u001b[16Gd an\u001b[21Gorganizer.\u001b[32GTwo\u001b[36Gof\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gdocx\u001b[48Gevents\u001b[55Gspan\u001b[60Gseveral\u001b[68Gdays\u001b[73G(\"Festive\u001b[83Gmarket\u001b[90Gat\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gjetty\",\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G19–24 Dec, and \"Land rates help desk\", Jan–Mar),\u001b[55Go they ne\u001b[65Gd a real end date.\u001b[84GPlain\u001b[90Gnews\u001b[95Grecords\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcan't store one. The docx also lists Cos\u001b[47Gand Registration,\u001b[65Gwhich\u001b[71Ghave\u001b[76Gno\u001b[79Gfield.\u001b[86GThose\u001b[92Gcan\u001b[96Ggo\u001b[99Gin\u001b[102Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gteaser or body text.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt reuses what's already set up.\u001b[22m Editors keep working with\u001b[64Gnews\u001b[69Grecords\u001b[77Gin\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84G\"News\u001b[90Grecords\"\u001b[99Gfolder.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[8G news detail page, the categories and the search indexer for news\u001b[74Gcover\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gevents\u001b[91Gas\u001b[94Gwell.\u001b[100GYou\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdon't\u001b[11Gneed\u001b[16Ga\u001b[18Gsecond\u001b[25Gdata\u001b[30Gmodel\u001b[36Gor\u001b[39Gplugin\u001b[46Gset.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mPast events drop off by themselves.\u001b[41G\u001b[22mTh\u001b[44G even\u001b[50Gs list can show upcoming events only,\u001b[88Gsor\u001b[92Ged\u001b[95Gby start\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  dat\u001b[9G, so the\u001b[18G\"Past events\"\u001b[32Gpart of the docx needs no ma\u001b[61Gual handling. The home p\u001b[86Gge\u001b[89Gnews plugin is\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  the\u001b[10Gset to l\u001b[19Gav\u001b[22G eve\u001b[27Gts out, so th\u001b[41G two lists\u001b[52Gstay s\u001b[59Gpar\u001b[64Ge.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3GOn the home page, a second news\u001b[35Gplugin\u001b[42Gunder\u001b[48Gthe\u001b[52Gnews,\u001b[58Gset\u001b[62Gto\u001b[65Gupcoming\u001b[74Gevents\u001b[81Gwith\u001b[86Ga\u001b[88Glimit\u001b[94Gof\u001b[97G3,\u001b[100Grenders\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthrough\u001b[11Ga\u001b[13Gsmall\u001b[19GFluid\u001b[25Gtemplate\u001b[34Goverride.\u001b[44GThat\u001b[49Gtemplate\u001b[58Goutputs\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gdesign's\u001b[79G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m<ul class=\"events\">\u001b[99G\u001b[39mwith\r\u001b[1B  the \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mevents__date\u001b[39m badge, and the SCSS for it is already in the sitepackage.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3GTwo alternatives I'd rule out:\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  - \u001b[1mPlain news with an \"Events\" category:\u001b[22m no end date, no location, and showing future dates in\u001b[97Gdate\u001b[102Gorder\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bwould take workarounds.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mlochmueller/calendarize\u001b[39m (15.1.0, TYPO3 14 compatible):\u001b[22m a separate event model with recurrence and\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcalendar views.\u001b[21GThat's\u001b[28Gmore\u001b[33Gthan\u001b[38Gsix\u001b[42Gone-off\u001b[50Gevents\u001b[57Gneed,\u001b[63Gand\u001b[67Geditors\u001b[75Gwould\u001b[81Ghave\u001b[86Gto\u001b[89Glearn\u001b[95Ga\u001b[97Gsecond\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsystem.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[87.770683, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5Git fits. It's Composer-only: the TER listing stops\u001b[56Gat 6.x for TYPO3\u001b[73G12, which doesn't matter for a\u001b[104G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BComposer\u001b[14Gproject.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe events fit its fields.\u001b[32G\u001b[22mA\u001b[34Gnews\u001b[39Grecord\u001b[46Ggets\u001b[51Gan\u001b[54G\"is\u001b[58Gevent\"\u001b[65Gswitch,\u001b[73Gan\u001b[76Gend\u001b[80Gdate,\u001b[86Ga\u001b[88Gfull-day\u001b[97Gflag,\u001b[103Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Glocation and an organizer.\u001b[32GTwo of\u001b[39Gthe docx events span several days\u001b[73G(\"F\u001b[77Gstive market at the\u001b[97Gjetty\",\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B19–24 Dec, and \"Land rates\u001b[32Ghelp desk\", Jan–Mar), so they n\u001b[64Ged a real end dat\u001b[82G. Plain\u001b[90Gnews records\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcan't\u001b[11Gstore one. The\u001b[26Gdocx also lists Cost and Registratio\u001b[63G, which hav\u001b[75G no fi\u001b[82Gld. Those can go in the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bteaser or body text.\u001b[26G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt reuses what's already set up.\u001b[38G\u001b[22mEditors\u001b[46Gkeep\u001b[51Gworking\u001b[59Gwith\u001b[64Gnews\u001b[69Grecords\u001b[77Gin\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84G\"News\u001b[90Grecords\"\u001b[99Gfolder.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GThe news detail page, the categories and\u001b[46Gth\u001b[49G sea\u001b[54Gch indexer for\u001b[69Gn\u001b[71Gws cover\u001b[84Gev\u001b[87Gnts as well. You\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdon't nee\u001b[15G a second da\u001b[28Ga model \u001b[38G plugin\u001b[46Gset.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mPast events drop off by themselves.\u001b[22m The ev\u001b[48Gnts\u001b[52Glist\u001b[57Gcan\u001b[61Gshow\u001b[66Gupcoming\u001b[75Gevents\u001b[82Gonly,\u001b[88Gsorted\u001b[95Gby\u001b[98Gstart\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdate, so the \"Past events\" part of the docx needs no manual handling.\u001b[75GTh\u001b[78G home page news plugin is\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthen set\u001b[15Go leave events out, so the two lists stay separ\u001b[63Gte.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BOn\u001b[6Gthe\u001b[10Ghome\u001b[15Gpage,\u001b[21Ga\u001b[23Gsecond\u001b[30Gnews\u001b[35Gplugin\u001b[42Gunder\u001b[48Gthe\u001b[52Gnews,\u001b[58Gset\u001b[62Gto\u001b[65Gupcoming\u001b[74Gevents\u001b[81Gwith\u001b[86Ga\u001b[88Glimit\u001b[94Gof\u001b[97G3,\u001b[100Grenders\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthrough a small Fluid template overr\u001b[40Gde. That t\u001b[51Gmplate\u001b[58Gou\u001b[61Gputs the design's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m<ul class=\"events\">\u001b[39m with\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Be \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mevents__date\u001b[39m badge, and \u001b[32Ghe SCSS for\u001b[44Git is alre\u001b[55Gdy\u001b[58Gin the sit\u001b[69Gpacka\u001b[75Ge.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTwo\u001b[7Galternatives\u001b[20GI'd\u001b[24Grule\u001b[29Gout:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mPlain news with an \"Events\" category:\u001b[43G\u001b[22mno\u001b[46Gend\u001b[50Gdate,\u001b[56Gno\u001b[59Glocation,\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Gshowing\u001b[81Gfuture\u001b[88Gdates\u001b[94Gin\u001b[97Gdate\u001b[102Gorder\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gwould take workarounds.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mlochmueller/calendarize\u001b[39m (15.1.0, TYPO3 14 compatible):\u001b[60G\u001b[22ma\u001b[62Gseparate\u001b[71Gevent\u001b[77Gmodel\u001b[83Gwith\u001b[88Grecurrence\u001b[99Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcalendar views. That's more than six one-off events need, and editors woul\u001b[80G have to lea\u001b[93Gn a second\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsystem.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BOne\u001b[7Gthing\u001b[13GI\u001b[15Gstill\u001b[21Gneed\u001b[26Gto\u001b[29Gcheck\u001b[35Gbefore\u001b[42Gbuilding:\u001b[52Gthe\u001b[56Gexact\u001b[62Gplugin\u001b[69Gsetting\u001b[77Gnames\u001b[83Gin\u001b[86Geventnews\u001b[96G7.2\u001b[100Gfor\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[87.926365, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe events fit its fields.\u001b[22m A\u001b[34Gnews record gets an \"is event\" switch,\u001b[73Gan end date, a full-day flag, a\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bl\u001b[7Gcation\u001b[14Gand an organizer.\u001b[32GTwo\u001b[36Gof\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gdocx\u001b[48Gevents\u001b[55Gspan\u001b[60Gseveral\u001b[68Gdays\u001b[73G(\"Festive\u001b[83Gmarket\u001b[90Gat\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gjetty\",\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G19–24 Dec, and \"Land rates\u001b[32Ghelp desk\", Jan–Mar),\u001b[54Gso they need a real end \u001b[79Gate. Pl\u001b[87Gin news records\u001b[103G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcan'\u001b[10G store one. The docx als\u001b[36Glis\u001b[40Gs Cost and Regi\u001b[56Gtration, which have no fi\u001b[82Gld. Those can go in the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bteaser or body\u001b[20Gtext.\u001b[26G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt reuses what's already set up.\u001b[22m Editor\u001b[45G keep\u001b[51Gworking w\u001b[61Gth news records in the \"News re\u001b[93Gords\"\u001b[99Gfolder.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BThe news detail page,\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Gcategories\u001b[42Gand\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gsearch\u001b[57Gindexer\u001b[65Gfor\u001b[69Gnews\u001b[74Gcover\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gevents\u001b[91Gas\u001b[94Gwell.\u001b[100GYou\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdon't need a second data model or plugin\u001b[46Gs\u001b[48Gt.\u001b[51G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mPast events drop off by themselves.\u001b[22m The event\u001b[51G list\u001b[57Gcan show upcoming e\u001b[78Gnts only, sorted by start\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bate,\u001b[11Gso the\u001b[18G\"Past events\" part of the docx needs\u001b[55Gno\u001b[58Gmanual\u001b[65Ghandling.\u001b[75GThe\u001b[79Ghome\u001b[84Gpage\u001b[89Gnews\u001b[94Gplugin\u001b[101Gis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gthen set to leave events out, so the two lis\u001b[52Gstay\u001b[57Gseparate.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BOn the\u001b[10Ghome pag\u001b[19G, a\u001b[23Gsecond\u001b[30Gnews\u001b[35Gplugin\u001b[42Gunder the\u001b[52Gnews, set to upcoming\u001b[74Gevents\u001b[81Gwith\u001b[86Ga\u001b[88Glimit\u001b[94Gof\u001b[97G3,\u001b[100Grenders\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthrough\u001b[11Ga\u001b[13Gsmall\u001b[19GFluid\u001b[25Gtemplate\u001b[34Goverride.\u001b[44GThat\u001b[49Gtemplate\u001b[58Goutputs\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gdesign's\u001b[79G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m<ul class=\"events\">\u001b[99G\u001b[39mwith\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mevents__date\u001b[39m b\u001b[22Gdg\u001b[25G, and the\u001b[35GSCSS for it is alr\u001b[54Gady\u001b[58Gin the\u001b[65Gsitepackage.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTwo\u001b[7Galternatives\u001b[20GI'\u001b[23G rule ou\u001b[32G:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mPlain news with an \"Events\" category:\u001b[43G\u001b[22mno\u001b[46Gend\u001b[50Gdate,\u001b[56Gno\u001b[59Glocation,\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Gshowing\u001b[81Gfuture\u001b[88Gdates\u001b[94Gin\u001b[97Gdate\u001b[102Gorder\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  wou\u001b[9Gd take workarounds.\u001b[29G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mlochmueller/calendarize\u001b[39m (15.1.0, TYPO3 14 compatible):\u001b[22m a separate event model with\u001b[88Grecurre\u001b[96Gce and\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcalendar views. That'\u001b[27G more\u001b[33Gthan\u001b[38Gsix\u001b[42Gone-off\u001b[50Gevents\u001b[57Gneed,\u001b[63Gand\u001b[67Geditors\u001b[75Gwould\u001b[81Ghave\u001b[86Gto\u001b[89Glearn\u001b[95Ga\u001b[97Gsecond\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gsystem.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BOne thing\u001b[13GI\u001b[15Gstill\u001b[21Gneed\u001b[26Gto\u001b[29Gcheck\u001b[35Gbefore\u001b[42Gbuilding:\u001b[52Gthe\u001b[56Gexact\u001b[62Gplugin\u001b[69Gsetting\u001b[77Gnames\u001b[83Gin\u001b[86Geventnews\u001b[96G7.2\u001b[100Gfor\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\"upcoming\u001b[13Gonly\"\u001b[19Gand\u001b[23G\"exclude\u001b[32Gevents\".\u001b[41GI'll