[88.336758, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5Gteaser or body text.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt reuses what's already set up.\u001b[22m Editors keep working with news\u001b[71Gcords in \u001b[81Ghe\u001b[84G\"News\u001b[90Gr\u001b[92Gcords\" folder.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BThe news d\u001b[16Gtail pag\u001b[25G, the\u001b[31Gcategorie\u001b[42Gand the search indexer\u001b[65Gfor news cover the event\u001b[90G as well. You\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdon't need a second data\u001b[30Gmodel\u001b[36Gor\u001b[39Gplugin\u001b[46Gset.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mPast ev\u001b[13Gnts drop\u001b[22Goff by th\u001b[32Gmselves.\u001b[22m The ev\u001b[48Gnts list can s\u001b[63Gow upcoming eve\u001b[79Gts only, \u001b[89Go\u001b[91Gted by start\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdate, so\u001b[14Gthe \"Past \u001b[25Gvents\" part of the \u001b[45Gocx ne\u001b[52Gds no manual\u001b[65Ghandling. Th\u001b[78G hom\u001b[84Gpage new\u001b[94Gplugin is\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthen set to leave even\u001b[28Gs\u001b[30Gout, s\u001b[37G the two\u001b[46Glists\u001b[52Gstay\u001b[57Gseparate.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BOn th\u001b[9G home page, a s\u001b[25Gco\u001b[28Gd news plugin un\u001b[45Ger th\u001b[51G news,\u001b[58Gset to\u001b[65Gupcom\u001b[73G events with a limit\u001b[94Gof 3, renders\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthrough a smal\u001b[18G Fluid template override. That \u001b[50Gempl\u001b[55Gte outpu\u001b[64Gs the\u001b[70Gdesign's\u001b[79G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m<ul class=\"events\">\u001b[99G\u001b[39mwith\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe\u001b[7G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mevents__date\u001b[20G\u001b[39mbadge,\u001b[27Gand\u001b[31Gthe\u001b[35GSCSS\u001b[40Gfor\u001b[44Git\u001b[47Gis\u001b[50Galready\u001b[58Gin\u001b[61Gthe\u001b[65Gsitepackage.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTwo alternatives I'd rule ou\u001b[32G:\u001b[34G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mPlain news with an \"Events\" category:\u001b[22m no end\u001b[50Gdat\u001b[54G, no location, and showing\u001b[81Gfuture\u001b[88Gdates\u001b[94Gin\u001b[97Gdate\u001b[102Gorder\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bwould\u001b[11Gtake\u001b[16Gworkarounds.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mlochmueller/calendarize\u001b[39m (15.1.0, TYPO3 14 compatible):\u001b[60G\u001b[22ma\u001b[62Gseparate\u001b[71Gevent\u001b[77Gmodel\u001b[83Gwith\u001b[88Grecurrence\u001b[99Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcalendar views. That's more than six o\u001b[44Ge-off\u001b[50Gevents need, and editor\u001b[74G would\u001b[81Ghave to learn a\u001b[97Gsecond\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsystem.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BOne thing I still\u001b[21Gneed to ch\u001b[32Gck before\u001b[42Gbuilding: the exact plugin setting names in\u001b[86Geventnews 7.2 for\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\"upcoming\u001b[13Gonly\"\u001b[19Gand\u001b[23G\"exclude\u001b[32Gevents\".\u001b[41GI'll\u001b[46Gread\u001b[51Gthem\u001b[56Gfrom\u001b[61Gthe\u001b[65Gpackage\u001b[73Gonce\u001b[78Git's\u001b[83Ginstalled.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BShould I go\u001b[15Gahead? That means adding the packa\u001b[50Ge, ext\u001b[57Gnding \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mseed-news.php\u001b[77G\u001b[39mwith the\u001b[91Gs from the docx,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bre-exporting \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[39m, and adding the\u001b[41Ghome\u001b[46Gpage\u001b[51Gplugin and t\u001b[64Gm\u001b[66Glate.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✻\u001b[3GUnraveling… \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(30s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.4k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
