[92.121177, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mI recommend \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgeorgringer/eventnews\u001b[39m.\u001b[22m It extends the news \u001b[59Gxtension\u001b[68Gwith\u001b[73Gevents, which suits this project:\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt runs on your versions.\u001b[31G\u001b[22mVersion\u001b[39G7.2.0\u001b[45G(released\u001b[55G2026-10-09\u001b[66Gon\u001b[69GPackagist)\u001b[80Grequires\u001b[89G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3/cms-core \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m^13.4.29 || ^14.3\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgeorgringer/news ^13 || ^14\u001b[39m. Th\u001b[59G project uses\u001b[73G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcms-core ^14.3\u001b[88G\u001b[39mand \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mnews ^14.1\u001b[39m, so\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bit fits.\u001b[14GIt's Composer-only: the TER listing stops at 6.x for TYPO3\u001b[73G12, wh\u001b[80Gch\u001b[83Gdoesn't ma\u001b[94Gt\u001b[96Gr for a\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BComposer project.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe events fit its fields.\u001b[22m A news record gets\u001b[51Gan \"is event\"\u001b[65Gsw\u001b[68Gtch, an\u001b[76Gend date,\u001b[86Ga full-day flag, a\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Blocation and an organizer.\u001b[32GTwo\u001b[36Gof\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gdocx\u001b[48Gevents\u001b[55Gspan\u001b[60Gseveral\u001b[68Gdays\u001b[73G(\"Festive\u001b[83Gmarket\u001b[90Gat\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gjetty\",\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G19–24 Dec, and \"Land rates help desk\", Jan–Mar), so they need a\u001b[71Gal end da\u001b[81Ge.\u001b[84GPlain\u001b[90Gn\u001b[92Gws records\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcan't stor\u001b[16G one. Th\u001b[25G docx\u001b[31Galso list\u001b[42GCost and Registration,\u001b[65Gwhich have no field. Tho\u001b[90Ge can go in the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bteaser or body text.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mIt reus\u001b[13Gs what's\u001b[22Galready s\u001b[32