[98.575059, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt runs on your versions.\u001b[31G\u001b[22mVersion\u001b[39G7.2.0\u001b[45G(released\u001b[55G2026-10-09\u001b[66Gon\u001b[69GPackagist)\u001b[80Grequires\u001b[89G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3/cms-core \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m^13.4.29 || ^14.3\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgeorgringer/news ^13 || ^14\u001b[39m. The project uses \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcms-core ^14.3\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mnews ^14.1\u001b[39m, so\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bit fits. It's Composer-only: the TER listing stops\u001b[56Gat 6.x for TYPO3\u001b[73G12, which doesn't matter for a\u001b[104G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BComposer\u001b[14Gproject.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe events fit its fields.\u001b[32G\u001b[22mA\u001b[34Gnews\u001b[39Grecord\u001b[46Ggets\u001b[51Gan\u001b[54G\"is\u001b[58Gevent\"\u001b[65Gswitch,\u001b[73Gan\u001b[76Gend\u001b[80Gdate,\u001b[86Ga\u001b[88Gfull-day\u001b[97Gflag,\u001b[103Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Glocation and an organizer.\u001b[32GTwo of\u001b[39Gthe docx events span several days\u001b[73G(\"F\u001b[77Gstive market at the\u001b[97Gjetty\",\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B19–24 Dec, and \"Land rates\u001b[32Ghelp desk\", Jan–Mar), so they n\u001b[64Ged a real end dat\u001b[82G. Plain\u001b[90Gnews records\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcan't\u001b[11Gstore one. The\u001b[26Gdocx also lists Cost and Registratio\u001b[63G, which hav\u001b[75G no fi\u001b[82Gld. Those can go in the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bteaser or body text.\u001b[26G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt reuses what's already set up.\u001b[38G\u001b[22mEditors\u001b[46Gkeep\u001b[51Gworking\u001b[59Gwith\u001b[64Gnews\u001b[69Grecords\u001b[77Gin\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84G\"News\u001b[90Grecords\"\u001b[99Gfolder.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GThe news detail page, the categories and\u001b[46Gth\u001b[49G sea\u001b[54Gch indexer for\u001b[69Gn\u001b[71Gws cover\u001b[84Gev\u001b[87Gnts as well. You\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdon't nee\u001b[15G a second da\u001b[28Ga model \u001b[38G plugin\u001b[46Gset.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mPast events drop off by themselves.\u001b[22m The ev\u001b[48Gnts\u001b[52Glist\u001b[57Gcan\u001b[61Gshow\u001b[66Gupcoming\u001b[75Gevents\u001b[82Gonly,\u001b[88Gsorted\u001b[95Gby\u001b[98Gstart\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdate, so the \"Past events\" part of the docx needs no manual handling.\u001b[75GTh\u001b[78G home page news plugin is\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthen set\u001b[15Go leave events out, so the two lists stay separ\u001b[63Gte.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BOn\u001b[6Gthe\u001b[10Ghome\u001b[15Gpage,\u001b[21Ga\u001b[23Gsecond\u001b[30Gnews\u001b[35Gplugin\u001b[42Gunder\u001b[48Gthe\u001b[52Gnews,\u001b[58Gset\u001b[62Gto\u001b[65Gupcoming\u001b[74Gevents\u001b[81Gwith\u001b[86Ga\u001b[88Glimit\u001b[94Gof\u001b[97G3,\u001b[100Grenders\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthrough a small Fluid template overr\u001b[40Gde. That t\u001b[51Gmplate\u001b[58Gou\u001b[61Gputs the design's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m<ul class=\"events\">\u001b[39m with\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Be \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mevents__date\u001b[39m badge, and \u001b[32Ghe SCSS for\u001b[44Git is alre\u001b[55Gdy\u001b[58Gin the sit\u001b[69Gpacka\u001b[75Ge.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTwo\u001b[7Galternatives\u001b[20GI'd\u001b[24Grule\u001b[29Gout:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mPlain news with an \"Events\" category:\u001b[43G\u001b[22mno\u001b[46Gend\u001b[50Gdate,\u001b[56Gno\u001b[59Glocation,\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Gshowing\u001b[81Gfuture\u001b[88Gdates\u001b[94Gin\u001b[97Gdate\u001b[102Gorder\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gwould take workarounds.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mlochmueller/calendarize\u001b[39m (15.1.0, TY\u001b[69G\u001b[22me\u001b[71Gevent\u001b[77Gmodel\u001b[83Gwith