[99.126216, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bit fits. It's Composer-only: the TER listing stops\u001b[56Gat 6.x for TYPO3\u001b[73G12, which doesn't matter for a\u001b[104G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BComposer\u001b[14Gproject.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe events fit its fields.\u001b[32G\u001b[22mA\u001b[34Gnews\u001b[39Grecord\u001b[46Ggets\u001b[51Gan\u001b[54G\"is\u001b[58Gevent\"\u001b[65Gswitch,\u001b[73Gan\u001b[76Gend\u001b[80Gdate,\u001b[86Ga\u001b[88Gfull-day\u001b[97Gflag,\u001b[103Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Glocation and an organizer.\u001b[32GTwo of\u001b[39Gthe docx events span several days\u001b[73G(\"F\u001b[77Gstive market at the\u001b[97Gjetty\",\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B19–24 Dec, and \"Land rates\u001b[32Ghelp desk\", Jan–Mar), so they n\u001b[64Ged a real end dat\u001b[82G. Plain\u001b[90Gnews records\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcan't\u001b[11Gstore one. The\u001b[26Gdocx also lists Cost and Registratio\u001b[63G, which hav\u001b[75G no fi\u001b[82Gld. Those can go in the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bteaser or body text.\u001b[26G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt reuses what's already set up.\u001b[38G\u001b[22mEditors\u001b[46Gkeep\u001b[51Gworking\u001b[59Gwith\u001b[64Gnews\u001b[69Grecords\u001b[77Gin\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84G\"News\u001b[90Grecords\"\u001b[99Gfolder.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GThe news detail page, the categories and\u001b[46Gth\u001b[49G sea\u001b[54Gch indexer for\u001b[69Gn\u001b[71Gws cover\u001b[84Gev\u001b[87Gnts as well. You\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdon't nee\u001b[15G a second da\u001b[28Ga model \u001b[38G plugin\u001b[46Gset.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mPast events drop off by themselves.\u001b[22m The ev\u001b[48Gnts\u001b[52Glist\u001b[57Gcan\u001b[61Gshow\u001b[66Gupcoming\u001b[75Gevents\u001b[82Gonly,\u001b[88Gsorted\u001b[95Gby\u001b[98Gstart\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdate, so the \"Past events\" part of the docx needs no manual handling.\u001b[75GTh\u