ease pattern:\u001b[22m about one major\u001b[38Gor\u001b[41Gminor\u001b[47Grelease\u001b[55Ga\u001b[57Gyear,\u001b[63Gfollowing\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77GTYPO3\u001b[83Gversions:\u001b[93G6.0\u001b[97Gin\u001b[100G2023\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfor\u001b[9GTYPO3\u001b[15G12,\u001b[19G7.0\u001b[23Gin\u001b[26G2024\u001b[31Gfor\u001b[35G13,\u001b[39G7.1\u001b[43Gin\u001b[46G2025,\u001b[52Gand\u001b[56G7.2\u001b[60Gin\u001b[63G2026\u001b[68Gfor 14.\u001b[76GThe\u001b[80Grepository\u001b[91Gisn't\u001b[97Garchived.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat to keep in mind:\u001b[25G\u001b[22mwork\u001b[30Gcomes\u001b[36Gin\u001b[39Gbursts,\u001b[47Gand\u001b[51Geverything\u001b[62Gdepends\u001b[70Gon\u001b[73Gone\u001b[77Gmaintainer.\u001b[89GThat's\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gsame\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Grisk you\u001b[12Galready take with \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgeorgringer/news\u001b[39m,\u001b[48Gand\u001b[52Geventnews\u001b[62Gtends\u001b[68Gto\u001b[71Gget\u001b[75Gits\u001b[79Gupdate\u001b[86Gsoon\u001b[91Gafter\u001b[97Gnews\r\u001b[1B  supports a new TYPO3 version. If it were abandoned, the events would still be ordinary news records with\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Ba\u001b[5Gfew extra columns, so moving them to plain news or another extension would be manageable.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BMy\u001b[6Grecommendation stands. Should\u001b[36GI\u001b[38Ggo\u001b[41Gahead\u001b[47Gwith\u001b[52Git?\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBaked for 12s · done 7:14 PM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B❯ \r\u001b[38C\u001b[2B\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
