[255.893534, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRecent work:\u001b[18G\u001b[22mat\u001b[21Gthe\u001b[25Gend\u001b[29Gof\u001b[32GAugust\u001b[39G2026\u001b[44Gthere\u001b[50Gwere\u001b[55Gabout\u001b[61Gten\u001b[65Gcommits\u001b[73Gof\u001b[76Greal\u001b[81Gfixes\u001b[87Gand\u001b[91Gfeatures.\u001b[101GTwo\u001b[105Gof\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gthe fixes matter for y\u001b[28Gur multi-day events: an\u001b[52Gevent now \u001b[63Ghows\u001b[68Gin \u001b[72Gvery month it runs through, and\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsearching a\u001b[17Gdate\u001b[22Grange\u001b[28Gfinds\u001b[34Gevents\u001b[41Gthat\u001b[46Gspan\u001b[51Git.\u001b[55GLocation\u001b[64Grecords\u001b[72Galso\u001b[77Ggained\u001b[84Gaddress\u001b[92Gfields.\u001b[100GThe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Glast commit w\u001b[19Gs\u001b[21Gon 2026-10-09.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIssues:\u001b[22m that batch closed\u001b[31Glong-st\u001b[39Gnding i\u001b[47Gsues\u001b[52Gtoo, some\u001b[62Gof them y\u001b[72Gars old (#81,\u001b[86G#153, #184, #191,\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B#198). 29\u001b[15Gissues\u001b[22Gare still op\u001b[35Gn.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRelease pattern:\u001b[22m about one major\u001b[38Gor\u001b[41Gminor\u001b[47Grelease\u001b[55Ga\u001b[57Gyear,\u001b[63Gfollowing\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77GTYPO3\u001b[83Gversions:\u001b[93G6.0\u001b[97Gin\u001b[100G2023\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gfor TYPO3 12, 7.0 in 2024\u001b[31Gf\u001b[33Gr 13, 7.1 in 2025,\u001b[52Gand 7.2 in 2026 for 14.\u001b[76GThe\u001b[80Grepository isn't archived.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat to keep in mind:\u001b[22m work co\u001b[33Ges in bursts,\u001b[47Gand ev\u001b[54Grything depends on\u001b[73Gon\u001b[77Gmaintainer. That's the\u001b[100Gsame\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Brisk you already take with \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mgeorgringer/news\u001b[39m, and\u001b[52Geventnews tends\u001b[68Gt\u001b[70G get its update s\u001b[88Gon\u001b[91Gafter\u