[277.001197, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5GT\u001b[9Gstart\u001b[15Ggoes in the no\u001b[30Gmal news date field (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdatetime\u001b[39m).\u001b[62G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5Geventnews\u001b[16Gd\u001b[18Gs \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mevent_end\u001b[39m, a dat\u001b[37G-and-time field, and \u001b[59G \"full day\" checkbox. These fields only app\u001b[103Gar\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bwhen\u001b[10G\"is event\"\u001b[21Gis\u001b[24Gticked.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BThe festive market\u001b[24Gbecomes \u001b[34Ge record: start 19 Dec\u001b[57G2026\u001b[62G16:00, end 24\u001b[76GDec\u001b[80G2026 22:00.\u001b[92G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhich list i\u001b[16G shows up in\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mUpcoming events list:\u001b[22m for\u001b[31Gan events-only\u001b[46Gplugin, eventnews replaces the n\u001b[79Gws time restriction with\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\"end\u001b[10Gdate\u001b[15Gis\u001b[18Gstill\u001b[24Gto\u001b[27Gcome,\u001b[33Gor\u001b[36Gstart\u001b[42Gdate\u001b[47Gis\u001b[50Gstill\u001b[56Gto\u001b[59Gcome\"\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mClasses/EventListener/ModifyDemandRepositoryEventListener.php\u001b[39m, around line 133). An event\u001b[98Gat has\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  already started stays in\u001b[30Gthe list until it\u001b[48Ge\u001b[51Gs. The \"Land rates help\u001b[75Gde\u001b[78Gk\" (18 Jan to 31 Mar 2027)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  stays visible through March. Plain news would drop it\u001b[59Gon 18 Jan\u001b[69Gary.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMonth and year views:\u001b[27G\u001b[22man even\u001b[35G appears in ev\u001b[50Gry\u001b[53Gmonth it ov\u001b[65Grlap\u001b[70G. That's th\u001b[83G#198 fix from\u001b[97GAugust\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B2026:\u001b[11Gbefore,\u001b[19Ga\u001b[21GJanuary\u001b[29Gto\u001b[32GMarch\u001b[38Gevent\u001b[44Gshowed\u001b[51Gup\u001b[54Gin\u001b[57GJanuary\u001b[65Gonly.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mEvents without an end date\u001b[22m only use\u001b[41Gt\u001b[44G star\u001b[50G da\u001b[54Ge.\u001b[57GOnce\u001b[62Gthat\u001b[67Gtime\u001b[72Ghas\u001b[76Gpassed,\u001b[84Gthey\u001b[89Gdrop\u001b[94Goff.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[1mWhat you'd have to build yourself\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mDisplay:\u001b[14G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[18Gnews\u001b[23Glist\u001b[28Gand\u001b[32Gdetail\u001b[39Gtemplates\u001b[49Gdon't\u001b[55Gshow\u001b[60G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249meventEnd\u001b[69G\u001b[39mat\u001b[72Gall.\u001b[77GOnly\u001b[82Geventnews'\u001b[93Gown\u001b[97Gmonth\r\u001b[1B    template does. Our home page template override has to output the range, for example \"19–24 Dec\". The\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdesign's\u001b[14Gdate\u001b[19Gbadge\u001b[25G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.events__date\u001b[39m,\u001b[41Ga\u001b[43Gfixed\u001b[49G4rem\u001b[54Gwidth)\u001b[61Gonly\u001b[66Ghas\u001b[70Groom\u001b[75Gfor\u001b[79Ga\u001b[81Gsingle\u001b[88Gday.\u001b[93GIt\u001b[96Gneeds\u001b[102Ga\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  range\u001b[11Gvaria\u001b[17Gt, for example \"19 Dec – 24 Dec\"\u001b[50Gon\u001b[53Gtwo\u001b[57Glines,\u001b[64Gor\u001b[67Ga\u001b[69Gwider\u001b[75Gbadge.\u001b[82GThat's\u001b[89Ga\u001b[91Gdecision\u001b[100Gfor\u001b[104Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdesign.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRepeating opening hours:\u001b[22m there's\u001b[38Gno field for something\u001b[61Glike\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Ghelp\u001b[75Gdesk's\u001b[82G\"Monday\u001b[90Gto\u001b[93GFriday,\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B9:00–15:00\". even\u001b[23Gnews has one start and one end and no recurrence. That text goes in the teaser\u001b[102Gor\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbody t\u001b[12Gxt. If you ever need real recurring\u001b[48Gevents wi\u001b[58Gh separate\u001b[69Gdates,\u001b[76Gthat's\u001b[83Gwhen\u001b[88Gcalendarize\u001b[100Gwould\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbe\u001b[8Gworth\u001b[14Git.\u001b[18GFor\u001b[22Gthe\u001b[26Gevents\u001b[33Gin\