e template\u001b[43Goverride has to output\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[71Gange, for\u001b[81Gexample \"19–24\u001b[96GD\u001b[98Gc\".\u001b[102GThe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdesign's d\u001b[16Gte badge (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.events__date\u001b[39m, a fix\u001b[47Gd 4rem \u001b[55Gidth) only h\u001b[68Gs room\u001b[75Gfor a single d\u001b[90Gy. It needs a\u001b[104G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Brange variant,\u001b[20Gfor\u001b[24Gexample\u001b[32G\"19\u001b[36GDec\u001b[40G–\u001b[42G24\u001b[45GDec\"\u001b[50Gon\u001b[53Gtwo\u001b[57Glines,\u001b[64Gor\u001b[67Ga\u001b[69Gwider\u001b[75Gbadge.\u001b[82GThat's\u001b[89Ga\u001b[91Gdecision\u001b[100Gfor\u001b[104Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdesign.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRepeating opening hours:\u001b[22m ther\u001b[35G'\u001b[37G no field for somethi\u001b[59Gg\u001b[61Glike the help desk's \"M\u001b[85Gnday to Frid\u001b[98Gy,\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B9:00–15:00\". eventnews\u001b[28Ghas on\u001b[35G start and on\u001b[49G \u001b[52Gd and no recurr\u001b[68Gnce. Tha\u001b[77G text\u001b[83Ggo\u001b[86Gs\u001b[88Gin the teaser or\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Body text. If you ever need\u001b[33Greal recurring events with\u001b[60Gseparate dates,\u001b[76Gthat's\u001b[83Gwhen\u001b[88Gcalendarize\u001b[100Gwould\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gbe worth\u001b[14Git.\u001b[18GFor the\u001b[26Gevents\u001b[33Gin\u001b[36Gthe docx, start and e\u001b[58Gd\u001b[60Ga\u001b[62Ge enough.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSorting:\u001b[22m the list\u001b[23Gis sorted by\u001b[36Gst\u001b[39Grt d\u001b[44Gte\u001b[47Gin ascending\u001b[60Gorder. An event that's alre\u001b[88Gdy running\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btherefore\u001b[15Gappears\u001b[23Gabove\u001b[29Gevents\u001b[36Gthat\u001b[41Gstart\u001b[47Glater.\u001b[54GFor\u001b[58Ga\u001b[60G\"what's\u001b[68Gon\"\u001b[72Glist\u001b[77Gthat's\u001b[84Gusually\u001b[92Gwhat\u001b[97Gyou\u001b[101Gwant.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BS