\u001b[1mUpcom\u001b[11Gng\u001b[14Gevents list:\u001b[22m for\u001b[31Gan\u001b[34Gevents-only\u001b[46Gplugin,\u001b[54Geventnews\u001b[64Greplaces\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Gnews\u001b[82Gtime\u001b[87Grestriction\u001b[99Gwith\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\"end date is still to\u001b[27Gc\u001b[29Gme, or start date is still to come\"\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mClasses/EventListener/ModifyDemandRepositoryEventListener.php\u001b[39m,\u001b[69Garound\u001b[76Gline 133).\u001b[87GAn\u001b[90Gevent\u001b[96Gthat\u001b[101Ghas\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Balready started stays in the list until it ends. The \"Land rates help desk\" (18 Jan to 31 Mar 2027)\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bstays vi\u001b[14Gible through\u001b[27GMarc\u001b[32G.\u001b[34GPlain \u001b[41Gews\u001b[45Gwould drop it on 18 January.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMonth and year views:\u001b[27G\u001b[22man event \u001b[37Gppe\u001b[69Gs. That's\u001b[79Gthe\u001b[83G#198\u001b[88Gfix\u001b[92Gfrom\u001b[97GAugust\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
