Grestriction\u001b[99Gwith\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\"end date is still to\u001b[27Gc\u001b[29Gme, or start date is still to come\"\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mClasses/EventListener/ModifyDemandRepositoryEventListener.php\u001b[39m,\u001b[69Garound\u001b[76Gline 133).\u001b[87GAn\u001b[90Gevent\u001b[96Gthat\u001b[101Ghas\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Balready started stays in the list until it ends. The \"Land rates help desk\" (18 Jan to 31 Mar 2027)\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bstays vi\u001b[14Gible through\u001b[27GMarc\u001b[32G.\u001b[34GPlain \u001b[41Gews\u001b[45Gwould drop it on 18 January.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMonth and year views:\u001b[27G\u001b[22man event \u001b[37Gppears in every month\u001b[59Git\u001b[62Goverlaps. That's\u001b[79Gthe\u001b[83G#198\u001b[88Gfix\u001b[92Gfrom\u001b[97GAugust\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G2026: before, a January to March event\u001b[44Gshowed up i\u001b[56G January only.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mEvents without an end date\u001b[32G\u001b[22monly use the start\u001b[51Gdate.\u001b[57GOnce that time\u001b[72Ghas\u001b[76Gpassed,\u001b[84Gthey\u001b[89Gdrop\u001b[94Goff.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G                          \u001b[32G    \u001b[37G   \u001b[69G\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
