utput the range,\u001b[77Gfor example \"19–24 Dec\". The\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bd\u001b[7Gsign's\u001b[15Gate badge (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.events__date\u001b[39m, a\u001b[43Gfixed 4rem width) only\u001b[66Ghas\u001b[71Goom for a\u001b[81Gsingle day. It\u001b[96Gn\u001b[98Geds\u001b[102Ga\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Brange vari\u001b[16Gnt, for example \"19 Dec – 24 D\u001b[47Gc\" on t\u001b[55Go lines, or \u001b[68G wider\u001b[75Gbadge. That's \u001b[90G decision for\u001b[104Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdesign.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRepeating opening hours:\u001b[30G\u001b[22mthere's\u001b[38Gno\u001b[41Gfield\u001b[47Gfor\u001b[51Gsomething\u001b[61Glike\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Ghelp\u001b[75Gdesk's\u001b[82G\"Monday\u001b[90Gto\u001b[93GFriday,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G9:00–15:00\". eventnews has on\u001b[35G \u001b[37Gtart and one end and \u001b[59Go\u001b[61Grecurrence. That text g\u001b[85Ges in the te\u001b[98Gser\u001b[102Gor\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbody text. If you ever\u001b[28Gneed r\u001b[35Gal recurring \u001b[49Gv\u001b[52Gts with separat\u001b[68G dates, \u001b[77Ghat's\u001b[83Gwh\u001b[86Gn\u001b[88Gcalendarize would\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Be worth it. For the events\u001b[33Gin the docx, start and end\u001b[60Gare enough.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSorting:\u001b[14G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[18Glist is\u001b[26Gsorted\u001b[33Gby\u001b[36Gstart date in ascendi\u001b[58Gg\u001b[60Go\u001b[62Gder. An event\u001b[76Gthat's\u001b[83Galready\u001b[91Grunning\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtherefore appears\u001b[23Gabove events\u001b[36Gth\u001b[39Gt st\u001b[44Grt\u001b[47Glater. For a\u001b[60G\"what's on\" list that's usu\u001b[88Glly what you\u001b[101Gwant.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BShould\u001b[10GI\u001b[12Ggo\u001b[15Gahead\u001b[21Gon\u001b[24Gthat\u001b[29Gbasis?\u001b[36GBefore\u001b[43GI\u001b[45Gbuild\u001b[51Gthe\u001b[55Gtemplate,\u001b[65GI'd\u001b[69Gneed\u001b[74Gone\u001b[78Gchoice\u001b[85Gfrom\u001b[90Gyou:\u001b[95Ghow\u001b[99Gthe\u001b[103Gdate\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbadge should show\u001b[21Ga range.      \u001b[36G    \u001b[69G\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
