[328.294592, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G9:00–15:00\". eventnews has one start and one end\u001b[54Gan\u001b[57G no\u001b[61Grecurrence. That text goes\u001b[88Gin the teaser\u001b[102Gor\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbody text. If you ever ne\u001b[31Gd real recurring eve\u001b[52Gts with separate\u001b[69Gdat\u001b[73Gs, that's when c\u001b[90Glendar\u001b[97Gze\u001b[100Gw\u001b[102Guld\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bb\u001b[7G worth\u001b[14Git.\u001b[18GFor\u001b[22Gthe\u001b[26Gevents\u001b[33Gin\u001b[36Gthe\u001b[40Gdocx,\u001b[46Gstart\u001b[52Gand\u001b[56Gend\u001b[60Gare\u001b[64Genough.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSorting:\u001b[22m the list is sorted by \u001b[37Gtart date\u001b[47Gin a\u001b[52Gcending order. An\u001b[70Gevent that's alre\u001b[88Gdy runn\u001b[96Gng\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btherefore app\u001b[19Gars above events\u001b[36Gth\u001b[39Gt start lat\u001b[51Gr.\u001b[54GFor\u001b[58Ga \"what's on\" list that's usually wha\u001b[96G you want.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BShould I go ahead on that ba\u001b[32Gis?\u001b[36GBefore I build the t\u001b[57Gmpl\u001b[61Gt\u001b[63G, I'd need\u001b[74Gone\u001b[78Gchoice\u001b[85Gfrom\u001b[90Gyou:\u001b[95Ghow\u001b[99Gthe\u001b[103Gdate\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbadge should show a\u001b[23Grange.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GWorked for 26s · done 7:16 PM\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mgo ahead, show the range on two lines in the badge\u001b[39m                                                      \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mCall\u001b[10Gtypo3-dev-c\u001b[22Gmpanion\u001b[30G\u001b[1m2\u001b[22m times \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSkill\u001b[22m(typo3-distribution-content)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mLoaded\u001b[13Gskill\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u00