[703.127381, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5Gbody text, because eventnews has no fields for them.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GIt also adds an \"Ev\u001b[25Gnts\" plugin u\u001b[39Gder the news\u001b[52Gon the\u001b[59Ghome\u001b[64Gpage:\u001b[70Gevents\u001b[77Gonly,\u001b[83Gfrom\u001b[88Gtoday,\u001b[95Gsoonest\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gfirst, limit 3.\u001b[21GAn \u001b[25Gvent\u001b[30Gthat has star\u001b[44Ged\u001b[47Gstays list\u001b[58Gd until its\u001b[70Glast day.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GI left\u001b[12Gout \u001b[17Ghe docx's \"Past events\". Th\u001b[45Gy\u001b[47Gwould\u001b[53Gnever be shown, and \u001b[74Ghe health\u001b[84Gcamp\u001b[89Gis\u001b[92Galready\u001b[100Ga\u001b[102Gnews\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gitem.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mTemplates:\u001b[16G\u001b[22ma\u001b[18Gnew\u001b[22Gtemplate\u001b[31Glayout\u001b[38G\"events\"\u001b[47Gin\u001b[50G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mList.html\u001b[60G\u001b[39mand\u001b[64Ga\u001b[66Gnew\u001b[70Gpartial\u001b[78G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mPartials/List/Event.html\u001b[39m.\u001b[104GA\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gone-day event keeps the design's\u001b[39G22 / Nov\" badge; a range\u001b[64Gshows\u001b[70G\"19 Dec\u001b[78G–\" on the first line and \"24\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BDec\" on\u001b[13Gth\u001b[16G second.\u001b[25GEach title links\u001b[42Gto the\u001b[49Gdetail\u001b[56Gpage. There, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDetail.html\u001b[81G\u001b[39mshows the date range and\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthe place, and no \"All news\" link.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCSS:\u001b[22m the eve\u001b[18Gts list is now a grid,\u001b[41Gso\u001b[44Gall\u001b[48Gbadges\u001b[55Gin\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62Glist\u001b[67Gare\u001b[71Gas\u001b[74Gwide\u001b[79Gas\u001b[82Gthe\u001b[86Gwidest\u001b[93Gone\u001b[97Gand\u001b[101Gline\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gup. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmain.css\u001b[39m i\u001b[21Grebuilt; \u001b[31Gnly\u001b[35Gthe events rules changed.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mdata.xml\u001b[39m:\u001b[22m re-exported and p\u001b[33Gaced in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInitialisation/\u001b[39m. It\u001b[61Ghas\u001b[65G6\u001b[67Gmore\u001b[72Gnews\u001b[77Grecords\u001b[85Gand\u001b[89G1\u001b[91Gmore\u001b[96Gcontent\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gelement. Th\u001b[17G image files are the\u001b[38Gsame 19 as before.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mDocs:\u001b[22m a new \"Events\" s\u001b[28Gction\u001b[34Gin the sitep\u001b[47Gckage README,\u001b[61Gplus\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gseed-script\u001b[82Glist\u001b[87Gand\u001b[91Gthe\u001b[95Gexport\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gsteps. Th\u001b[15G root README now mentions\u001b[41Gthe events.\u001b[53G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I checked on this installation\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- The home page shows 22 Nov, 5 Dec\u001b[39Gand\u001b[43G12\u001b[46GDec.\u001b[51GThe\u001b[55G15\u001b[58GNov\u001b[62Gbeach\u001b[68Gclean-up\u001b[77Gis\u001b[80Galready\u001b[88Gpast\u001b[93Gand\u001b[97Gcorrectly\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdrops out.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe news on\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Ghome\u001b[26Gpage\u001b[31Gand\u001b[35Gthe\u001b[39Gnews\u001b[44Glist\u001b[49Gpage\u001b[54Gshow\u001b[59Gno\u001b[62Gevents.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BWith the\u001b[14Glimit rais\u001b[25Gd to 6, bo\u001b[37G range\u001b[44Gbadges r\u001b[53Gnder.\u001b[59GScr\u001b[63Genshots\u001b[71Gat\u001b[74G1280\u001b[79Gand\u001b[83G375\u001b[87Gpx\u001b[90Glook\u001b[95Gright.\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\"today\" \u001b[19Gemporarily\u001b[30Gset to 1 Feb 2027, the list show\u001b[63Gd only the\u001b[74Gland\u001b[79Grates help\u001b[90Gdes\u001b[95G(18 Jan\u001b[103G–\u001b[105G31\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GMar), s\u001b[13G \u001b[15G running event\u001b[31Gtays list\u001b[41Gd.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe fe\u001b[12Gtive market's de\u001b[29Gail page