[703.277378, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5Gfirst, limit 3. An\u001b[29G that has starte\u001b[46G stays listed\u001b[60Guntil\u001b[66Gits\u001b[70Glast\u001b[75Gday.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B left out the docx's \"Past events\". They\u001b[47Gwould \u001b[54Gever\u001b[59Gbe shown, and the\u001b[77Ghealth ca\u001b[87Gp is already a news\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bitem.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mTemplates:\u001b[16G\u001b[22ma new template layout \"events\"\u001b[47Gin \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mList.html\u001b[39m and a \u001b[67Gew par\u001b[74Gial \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mPartials/List/Event.html\u001b[39m. A\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bon\u001b[8G-day\u001b[13Gevent\u001b[19Gkeeps\u001b[25Gthe\u001b[29Gdesign's\u001b[38G\"22\u001b[42G/\u001b[44GNov\"\u001b[49Gbadge;\u001b[56Ga\u001b[58Grange\u001b[64Gshows\u001b[70G\"19\u001b[74GDec\u001b[78G–\"\u001b[81Gon\u001b[84Gthe\u001b[88Gfirst\u001b[94Gline\u001b[99Gand\u001b[103G\"24\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GDec\" on the second. Each title links to the detail page. There, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDetail.html\u001b[39m shows the date range and\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bth\u001b[8G plac\u001b[14G, and no \"All new\u001b[32G\" link.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCSS:\u001b[10G\u001b[22mthe events list is now a gr\u001b[38Gd, so all badges in the\u001b[62Glist are as wide as the wid\u001b[90Gst one \u001b[99Gd li\u001b[104Ge\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bup.\u001b[9G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmain.css\u001b[39m is rebui\u001b[27Gt; only the events\u001b[46Grules\u001b[52Gchanged.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mdata.xml\u001b[39m:\u001b[22m r\u001b[17G-exported and pl\u001b[34Gced in\u001b[41G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInitialisation/\u001b[39m.\u001b[58GIt has 6\u001b[67Gmore ne\u001b[75Gs records and 1 more co\u001b[99Gtent\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Belement. The\u001b[19Gmag\u001b[23G f\u001b[27Ges\u001b[30Gare the sam\u001b[42G 19\u001b[46Gas before.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mDocs:\u001b[22m a new \"Events\" section in the\u001b[41Gsitepackage README,\u001b[61Gplus the seed-\u001b[76Gc\u001b[78Gipt list and\u001b[91Gthe export\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bst\u001b[8Gps. The root README now mentions the events.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I checked on this installation\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe\u001b[9Ghome\u001b[14Gpage\u001b[19Gshows\u001b[25G22\u001b[28GNov,\u001b[33G5\u001b[35GDec\u001b[39Gand\u001b[43G12\u001b[46GDec.\u001b[51GThe\u001b[55G15\u001b[58GNov\u001b[62Gbeach\u001b[68Gclean-up\u001b[77Gis\u001b[80Galready\u001b[88Gpast\u001b[93Gand\u001b[97Gcorrectly\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  drops out.\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1Bnews\u001b[14Gon the home page and\u001b[35Gthe\u001b[39Gnews list page show no\u001b[62Gevents.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GWith the limit\u001b[20Graised\u001b[27Gto\u001b[30G6,\u001b[33Gboth\u001b[38Grange\u001b[44Gbadges\u001b[51Grender.\u001b[59GScreenshots\u001b[71Gat\u001b[74G1280\u001b[79Gand\u001b[83G375\u001b[87Gpx\u001b[90Glook\u001b[95Gright.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BWith \"today\" t\u001b[20Gmp\u001b[23Grarily set to 1\u001b[39GF\u001b[41Gb 2027,\u001b[49Gthe list sh\u001b[61Gw\u001b[63Gd only\u001b[70Gthe\u001b[74Gland\u001b[79Grates\u001b[85Ghelp\u001b[90Gdesk\u001b[95G(18\u001b[99GJan\u001b[103G–\u001b[105G31\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GMar), so\u001b[14Ga running \u001b[25Gvent\u001b[30Gstays listed.\u001b[44G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BThe festive market's detail page shows \"19 Dec\u001b[52Gmber 2026 – 24 December 2026 · Jetty and fish market\".\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GI set\u001b[11Gb\u001b[13Gth\u001b[16Gplug\u001b[22G s\u001b[25Gtting\u001b[31G back af\u001b[41Grwards.\u001b[49GSnapshots\u001b[59G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbefore-events\u001b[73G\u001b[39mand\u001b[77G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mafter-events\u001b[90G\u001b[39mexist.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mLimitations\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[31;