[866.900916, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5Gshows\u001b[11Gon the d\u001b[20Gta\u001b[23Gl pag\u001b[29G as\u001b[33G\"\u001b[1mRegistration:\u001b[48G\u001b[22m…\".\u001b[52GEditors\u001b[60Gchange\u001b[67Git\u001b[70Glike\u001b[75Gany\u001b[79Gother\u001b[85Gtext.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BThat\u001b[10Gfits the docx as it \u001b[31Gtands. Four of the six\u001b[54Gevent\u001b[60G say\u001b[66GNot need\u001b[75Gd\".\u001b[79GThe other two are handled\u001b[105Gat\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Ban office,\u001b[16Gnot\u001b[20Gon\u001b[23Gthe\u001b[27Gwebsite:\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GYouth\u001b[13Gjob\u001b[17Gand\u001b[21Gskills\u001b[28Gfair:\u001b[34G\"Recommended,\u001b[48Gat\u001b[51Gthe\u001b[55GEducation\u001b[65GOffice\"\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  - Festive market: \"Traders apply\u001b[38Gfor\u001b[42Ga\u001b[44Gstall\u001b[50Gat\u001b[53Gthe\u001b[57GTrade\u001b[63G&\u001b[65GMarkets\u001b[73GOffice\u001b[80Guntil\u001b[86G1\u001b[88GDecember\"\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- The \u001b[10Gon\u001b[13Gact form doesn't \u001b[31Go\u001b[33Gnt either. It's\u001b[49Ga general\u001b[59Gform on\u001b[67Gthe \"Contact\"\u001b[81Gpage and isn't\u001b[96Glinked to\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  an\u001b[8G event.\u001b[16G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mIf you want people to register online\u001b[22m, there\u001b[48Gare\u001b[52Gtwo ways:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mA form for each event that needs one.\u001b[44G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[48Gsite\u001b[53Galready\u001b[61Ghas\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gcore\u001b[74Gform\u001b[79Gframework,\u001b[90Gwhich\u001b[96Gruns\u001b[101Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   contact form.\u001b[20GYou'd add a small regis\u001b[44Gration form (name, phone, email) that emails the office, and\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   place it on that\u001b[23Gevent's detail page or link it from the ev\u001b[66Gnt.\u001b[70GThis\u001b[75Gis little\u001b[85Gwork \u001b[91Gnd need\u001b[99G no\u001b[103Gnew\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bdata\u001b[11Gmodel.\u001b[18GBut\u001b[22Gregistrations\u001b[36Gonly\u001b[41Garrive\u001b[48Gas\u001b[51Gemails:\u001b[59Gthere's\u001b[67Gno\u001b[70Gparticipant\u001b[82Glist,\u001b[88Gno\u001b[91Gseat\u001b[96Glimit\u001b[102Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   no deadline.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mAn event extension with registration\u001b[22m,\u001b[44Gfor\u001b[48Gexample\u001b[56G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mderhansen/sf_event_mgt\u001b[79G\u001b[39m(version\u001b[88G9.0.6,\u001b[95Greleased\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   2026-10-09, TYPO3 \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m^14.3\u001b[39m). It handles\u001b[43Gregistrations\u001b[57Gas\u001b[60Grecords,\u001b[69Gwith\u001b[74Gseat\u001b[79Glimits,\u001b[87Gdeadlines,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bwaitlists,\u001b[17Gconfirmation\u001b[30Gemails\u001b[37Gand\u001b[41Ga\u001b[43Gparticipant\u001b[55Glist\u001b[60Gin\u001b[63Gthe\u001b[67Gbackend.\u001b[76GBut\u001b[80Git\u001b[83Gbrings\u001b[90Gits\u001b[94Gown\u001b[98Gevent\r\u001b[1B     model, so it would replace eventnews rather than sit next to it. The events would move out of the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bnews\u001b[11Grecords,\u001b[20Gand\u001b[24Gthe\u001b[28Gtemplates\u001b[38Gand\u001b[42Gseed\u001b[47Gwould\u001b[53Gbe\u001b[56Gredone.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  For what the docx asks for today, the current text is enough. If the job fair or the market should\u001b[102Gtake\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bregistrations online, I'd start with option 1. Option 2 only pays off once the municipality needs seat\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Blimits or participant lists.\u001b[K\r\u001b[28C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.0k tokens · \u001b[38;2;173;173;173mthinking\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m)\u001b[39m\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
