[936.698783, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTo\u001b[6Gbuild it into\u001b[20Gthe see\u001b[28G,\u001b[30Ghere's what the s\u001b[48Gte\u001b[51Ghas to link\u001b[63Gto:\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mPages:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- Festive market\u001b[22G(traders\u001b[31Gapply\u001b[37Gfor\u001b[41Ga\u001b[43Gstall):\u001b[51G\"Trade\u001b[58G&\u001b[60Gtourism\"\u001b[69G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/trade-tourism\u001b[39m)\u001b[86Gor\u001b[89G\"Market\u001b[97Gfees\"\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/revenue-payments/market-fees\u001b[39m).\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- Job fair (registration at \u001b[34Ghe E\u001b[39Gucation Office): there's no education page. \"Contact\" (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/contact\u001b[39m)\u001b[104Gis\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B the nearest fit.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mEmail addresses:\u001b[22m the site only uses \u001b[38;2;177;185;249minfo@mtosafi.example\u001b[39m (Contact\u001b[71Gpage) a\u001b[79Gd \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mreport@mtosafi.example\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m(\"Repo\u001b[12Gt a problem\"). Th\u001b[30G docx gives\u001b[42Gphone n\u001b[50Gmbers\u001b[56Gfor the\u001b[64Goffices\u001b[72Gbut\u001b[76Gno\u001b[79Gemail\u001b[85Gaddresses.\u001b[96GI\u001b[98Gwouldn't\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Binvent\u001b[12Gaddresses\u001b[22Gfor\u001b[26Gthe\u001b[30GEducation\u001b[40GOffice\u001b[47Gor\u001b[50Gthe\u001b[54GTrade\u001b[60G&\u001b[62GMarkets\u001b[70GOffice,\u001b[78Gbecause\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gmunicipality\u001b[103Ghas\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  to supply th\u001b[18Gse.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTwo ways to do it:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G1. \u001b[1mA link in the text (recommended):\u001b[40G\u001b[22mfor\u001b[44Gexample\u001b[52G\"Registration:\u001b[67GRecommended,\u001b[80Gat\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87GEducation\u001b[97GOffice\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B(…)\".\u001b[12GThe\u001b[16Gseed\u001b[21Gscript\u001b[28Gwrites\u001b[35Git\u001b[38Gthe\u001b[42Gway\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gtext\u001b[55Geditor\u001b[62Gwould.\u001b[69GEach\u001b[74Gevent\u001b[80Gcan\u001b[84Guse\u001b[88Gwhatever\u001b[97Gfits,\u001b[103Gand\r\u001b[1B     no template change is needed.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mA separate registration link field\u001b[41G\u001b[22mshown\u001b[47Gas\u001b[50Ga\u001b[52Gbutton\u001b[59G(\"Register\")\u001b[72Gon\u001b[75Gthe\u001b[79Gdetail\u001b[86Gpage\u001b[91Gand\u001b[95Gmaybe\u001b[101Gin\u001b[104Gthe\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   l\u001b[8Gst. That\u001b[17Glooks tidier, but\u001b[35Gev\u001b[38Gntnews has no such\u001b[57Gfield.\u001b[64GThe\u001b[68Gsitepackage\u001b[80Gwould\u001b[86Ghave\u001b[91Gto\u001b[94Gadd\u001b[98Ga\u001b[100Gcolumn\r\u001b[1B     to the news table and render it. That's only worth it if most events will have registration.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTell me where the two registration lines should point, for example \"market → Market fees page, job fair\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B→\u001b[5Ginfo@mtosafi.example\", and I'll add the links to the\u001b[58Gseed\u001b[63Gand\u001b[67Gre-export\u001b[77G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 19s · done 7:27 PM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B❯ \r\u001b[38C\u001b[2B\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
