242memp\u001b[17Gates as `registrationLink` and\u001b[48G`r\u001b[51GgistrationLabel` through the cla\u001b[84Gs extension\u001b[96Gof\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m60\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mEXT:\u001b[17Gews, wh\u001b[25Gch merges `Clas\u001b[41Ges/Domain/Model/News.php` into its n\u001b[78Gws model, as\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m61\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mEXT:eventnews does with its fields;\u001b[48Gafter a change to that class, flush th\u001b[87G caches.\u001b[96G  \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m2\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m         \u001b[22G     \u001b[28G      \u001b[35G                               \u001b[67G    \u001b[72G   \u001b[76G    \u001b[81G      \u001b[88G  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 163 \u001b[22m The site shows days, not times: PHP runs on the installation's time zone, which is\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 164 \u001b[22m not necessarily the municipality's. The seeded events carry their times in the text,\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m5\u001b[12G\u001b[22mtogether\u001b[21Gwith the cost and the registrati\u001b[55G, which h\u001b[65Gve no field; the t\u001b[84Gaser repeats\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m sh\u001b[16Gll command…\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
