[1313.66731, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe fresh-install proof still hasn't run.\u001b[22m The new\u001b[55G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[39m hasn't bee\u001b[75G \u001b[77Gmpo\u001b[81Gted anywhere yet. It\u001b[102Gneeds\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthe dat\u001b[13Gbase\u001b[18Gemptied, which auto mode blocked earl\u001b[56Ger, so it's your call. The\u001b[83Gfull fresh-in\u001b[97Gtall\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsteps are in the \u001b[23Goot README.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mI haven't opened the event form in the backend.\u001b[53G\u001b[22mI\u001b[55Gchecked\u001b[63Gthe\u001b[67Gdatabase\u001b[76Gcolumns,\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gexport\u001b[96Gand\u001b[100Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gfrontend, but not how the fields look in the ev\u001b[53Gnt form.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNothing\u001b[11Gis committed. Should I show\u001b[39Gyou\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Gdiff\u001b[52Gand\u001b[56Ga\u001b[58Gcommit\u001b[65Gmessage?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 2m 54s · done 7:32 PM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mthe events are on the news page and when you use de breadcrumb you only see news not events\u001b[39m             \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell com\u001b[19Gand \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m I'm giving events their own pages that mirror the news setup, with a breadcrumb of Home › Events › Event\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band\u001b[7Gan\u001b[10G\"All\u001b[15Gevents\"\u001b[23Glink\u001b[28Gon\u001b[31Gthe\u001b[35Ghome\u001b[40Gsection.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAdding\u001b[10GEvents\u001b[17Gand\u001b[21GEvent\u001b[27Gpages\u001b[33Gand\u001b[37Gplugins\u001b[45Gto\u001b[48Gthe\u001b